{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36336","headline":"题应天寺上方兼呈谦上人 · 方干","name":"题应天寺上方兼呈谦上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"中天坐卧见人寰，峭石垂藤不易攀。\n晴卷风雷归故壑，夜和猿鸟锁寒山。\n势横绿野苍茫外，影落平湖潋灩间。\n师在西岩最高处，路寻之字见禅关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36336.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36336","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}